SWEET nav6 fixes (patch 0251, T-49fb, G-10b-nav; log only, input injection unchanged except one drag length): (1) the SWEET FPS bin of patch 0141/0244 is also printed by the vsync timer (sweet_fps_tick from AppleCLCD::vsyncFired) once it is >= 1 s old and holds a distinct frame, same line format: before, a bin was printed only by the next swap after >= 1 s, so an animation that ended inside the second after a line was stamped when the next action's first swap came, outside its own window (nav5 rep 1 app-launch: 37 Clock-launch swaps stamped 4.4 s late, scorer 'no-anim' [obs run 20261108T062128Z-gputest-nav5]); (2) nav action settings-scroll-down drags 400 -> 2300 (was 700 -> 1800) so the Settings list returns to its top: nav5 rep 2 left it about 1.5 rows down and general-open tapped Display & Brightness, not General, so about-open opened nothing [obs camera frames nav-r02-settings-open vs nav-r01-settings-open, nav-r02-general-open]. No register, no store.
